BT /F1 18.00 Tf 0.1216 0.2275 0.3725 rg 51.024 768.189 Td (Taping the sheets together) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 51.024 734.173 Td (1. Trim or fold each A4 along its dashed page frame \(the frame marks the printable window\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 51.024 712.630 Td (2. Lay the sheets out in the grid: sheet A1 top-left, then A2 to its right, B1 below A1, and so on. The grid code sits in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 68.031 697.323 Td (each sheet's top-right corner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 51.024 675.780 Td (3. Overlap edge to edge so the black CORNER SQUARES from two sheets complete into one full square, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 68.031 660.472 Td (edge TICKS line up across the seam. Tape.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 51.024 638.929 Td (4. A pattern line that runs off a page has a small arrow telling you which sheet it continues on  follow it to keep) Tj ET
